# This bootstrap script targets a locally running Canton LocalNet (see
# ../../localnet/README.md) and has no required environment variables --
# the ledger URL and self-signed auth credentials in src/config.ts are
# LocalNet's well-known development defaults (see
# @canton-network/wallet-sdk's localNetStaticConfig).
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder for any future environment-specific
# overrides (e.g. pointing at a non-LocalNet participant).
